# The shellcheck pin, in two fields, because they are two different numbers:
# the PyPI package version of shellcheck-py, and the version the binary inside
# it reports. shellcheck-py 0.11.0.1 ships shellcheck 0.11.0, and a gate that
# pinned only one of them would either fail to resolve or fail to verify.
#
# <shellcheck-py package version> <shellcheck binary version>
0.11.0.1 0.11.0
